{"1":{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","en":"By the sky and the night comer -","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>طَّارِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>١</span>","pg":591},"2":{"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","tj":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>كَ مَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>طَّارِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٢</span>","pg":591},"3":{"ar":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","en":"It is the piercing star -","tj":"ٱ<tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ثَّاقِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٣</span>","pg":591},"4":{"ar":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍۢ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌۭ","en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُلُّ نَفْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>سٍ ل</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ <span class=end>٤</span>","pg":591},"5":{"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","en":"So let man observe from what he was created.","tj":"فَلْيَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْإِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ خُلِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>َ <span class=end>٥</span>","pg":591},"6":{"ar":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍۢ دَافِقٍۢ","en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","tj":"خُلِقَ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ءٍ د</tajweed>َافِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ٍ <span class=end>٦</span>","pg":591},"7":{"ar":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","tj":"يَخْرُجُ م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َيْنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صُّلْبِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>تَّر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٧</span>","pg":591},"8":{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌۭ","en":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able.","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ رَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> لَقَادِرٌ <span class=end>٨</span>","pg":591},"9":{"ar":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","tj":"يَوْمَ تُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِرُ <span class=end>٩</span>","pg":591},"10":{"ar":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍۢ وَلَا نَاصِرٍۢ","en":"Then man will have no power or any helper.","tj":"فَمَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>ُوَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ و</tajweed>َلَا نَاصِرٍ <span class=end>١٠</span>","pg":591},"11":{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","en":"By the sky which returns [rain]","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ ذَاتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عِ <span class=end>١١</span>","pg":591},"12":{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","en":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عِ <span class=end>١٢</span>","pg":591},"13":{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌۭ فَصْلٌۭ","en":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> لَقَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>لٌ ف</tajweed>َصْلٌ <span class=end>١٣</span>","pg":591},"14":{"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","en":"And it is not amusement.","tj":"وَمَا هُوَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْهَزْلِ <span class=end>١٤</span>","pg":591},"15":{"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًۭا","en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا <span class=end>١٥</span>","pg":591},"16":{"ar":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًۭا","en":"But I am planning a plan.","tj":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا <span class=end>١٦</span>","pg":591},"17":{"ar":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","tj":"فَمَهِّلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدَۢا <span class=end>١٧</span>","pg":591}}